{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_198_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_198","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，小邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_198_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_198","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，甲戌，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_198_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_198","textTraditional":"三、秋，郯子來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_198_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_198","textTraditional":"四、八月，晉荀吳帥師滅陸渾戎。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_198_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_198","textTraditional":"五、冬，有星孛於大辰。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_198_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_198","textTraditional":"一有一亡曰有。於大辰者，濫於大辰也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_198_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_198","textTraditional":"六、楚人及吳戰於長岸。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_198_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_198","textTraditional":"兩夷狄曰敗，中國與夷狄亦曰敗。楚人及吳戰於長岸，進楚子，故曰戰。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}